    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>Albedo is the ratio of reflected radiation to total incident radiation.<br/>[1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{albedo} = \\dfrac{P_{\\text{reflected}}}{P_{\\text{incident}}}\"></span><br/>[1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>Unitless (dimensionless).<br/>[1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>Higher cloud cover increases albedo.<br/>[1 mark]</p></section>"
